les away from you.\n\t\tAttacking or using any talent will break this effect.\n\t\tWhen this effect is broken or cancelled the sudden change in motion deals %d%% weapon damage to all foes around you. To do full damage you need to have moved at least 5 times, otherwise damage is lower (or null for no movement).\n\t\t#{italic}#The wheels of death! Amazing!#{normal}#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"把链锯深深插入地面，作为履带，增强自己的行动能力（移动速度增加 %d%%）。\n\t\t在你移动路线两侧的敌人被链锯割断，被击退 3 码。\n\t\t攻击或者使用其他技能的动作都会中断效果，同时冲击力对周围的敌人造成 %d%% 武器伤害。你需要至少移动五次来达到最高伤害，否则伤害会降低。若不移动则没有伤害。\n\t\t#{italic}#冲锋！死亡之轮！！#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"14c46f0f011b8f3611ee0b7213a8599daea3cbe7793364a090c85c618dd8bc44","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6ddbfdef08d5fe6cf0e13b01f2003c9b15f3dc6b76a4ed5856400476e5bad1ea","logical_entry_identity":"b33f6317962f3e514f24db3806eed1f4a18df576858711a1342ace20caba8524","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Where you walk nature grows! Well moss. Sticky moss.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你走到哪里，哪里就一片绿荫…虽然那是粘粘的苔藓。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"91cd1d1b9e9237e18b4f005d4130fbb399affe79531258b581c27e2efbea0b3b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6e250ba3801d6a7fc7358ea97f45f1690b37a54efc9aca2a66a79daaf0e51181","logical_entry_identity":"54b7bd04f15ae22bece236291801cbab1fd30fb0a71207d390a932884af4cf09","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"action at a distance","source_tag":"talent type","target":"远程动作"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c1f3b4b02c645feb45f8a59db179417f3ce9905ecb9fa6bf0ccfc3286240fd1b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6e42c327bf6f17e92165fc89900b340a31fb0d4885afe94efa498864af24015d","logical_entry_identity":"50aaaff7295f360163f342e1a39e8232eaa219b2fdb5700735d730c0ffed0d70","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"drain","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"吸血"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b851c7f4c446121ec88afa6dea583daba06ed005a35191bb7b61895ae1148cbb","component":"orcs","entry_revisi